 "text": "Hi, how are you going? Try using room with quiet wall, and keep any furniture of course from any walls. Then use a kitchen window instead, if there's one you can use. Stand on something if there's a noisey neighbour across the street. Then drapes are few days away. A thick blanket can make a big difference, or tape both sides of window with foam tape. Roughly how far away are the noise neighbour? A few floors makes a big difference, stand on a chair if you can. If you can't move, drapes are your friend.",
